rself towards them.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714680/extras/cdc78989ba2e7b418ae99b655040063a.poster.avif?t=1662219744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714680/extras/cdc78989ba2e7b418ae99b655040063a.webm?t=1662219744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714680/extras/cdc78989ba2e7b418ae99b655040063a.mp4?t=1662219744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>While mid-air, you only have <strong>4 licks.</strong> These reset every time you land back on the ground or hit a roof.<br></li><li>Get insulted by a flying snake for every mistake</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714680/extras/b5e4590348937a3e0d63d9a183541ad6.avif?t=1662219744\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE WORLD:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Traverse through <strong>9 distinct areas</strong> while being verbally abused by a flying snake.<br></li><li><strong>Listen</strong> to a unique soundtrack with a new track for each level.<br></li><li><strong>Experience </strong>the pain of losing all your progress, and being insulted for it at the same time.<br></li><li><strong>Discover</strong> the dark secret that lies at the top of the world!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714680/extras/64e86ab396e974fdb0badf6f4af02f08.poster.avif?t=1662219744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714680/extras/64e86ab396e974fdb0badf6f4af02f08.webm?t=1662219744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st